h of 310 mm and a muzzle ring diameter of 22 mm. The 177 mm long blade is single-edged and it has no fuller. The bayonets are manufactured exclusively for the Swiss Army by Victorinox and in the past by Wenger until ","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","attribution":"Alpha2412"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/Nightsight.JPG","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nightsight.JPG","width":638,"height":516,"caption":"SIG black special night sight","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","attribution":"Yoyomin"}],"countries":[{"name":"Switzerland","iso3":"CHE"}],"countryCodes":["CHE"],"manufacturers":[{"name":"SIG Sauer AG"}],"designers":[{"name":"Schweizerische Industrie Gesellschaft"}],"operators":[],"conflicts":[{"name":"War in Afghanistan"},{"name":"Sinai insurgency"},{"name":"2013 Lahad Datu standoff"},{"name":"Yemeni Civil War"}],"variants":[],"relatedEquipment":[],"compatibleAmmunition":[{"name":"5.56×45mm NATOKnown as 5.6 mm Gw Pat 90 in Switzerland.","slug":"5-56-45mm-natoknown-as-5-6-mm-gw-pat-90-in-switzerland"},{"name":"7.62×39mm","slug":"7-62-39mm"},{"name":".300 AAC Blackout","slug":"300-aac-blackout"},{"name":"6.5mm Creedmoor","slug":"6-5mm-creedmoor"}],"timeline":[{"year":1986,"title":"Production begins","detail":"1986–present"},{"year":1990,"title":"Enters service","detail":"1990–present"}],"serviceStart":1990,"sources":[{"title":"SIG SG 550 — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SIG_SG_550","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","revisionId":1362973149,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-01T13:03:21.155Z"}],"popularity":329,"featured":false,"publishedAt":"2026-08-01T13:03:21.155Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T13:03:21.155Z"}